{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV節目《港出好味道》第3集由COLLAR成員Gao夥拍廚藝專家Kit Mak遠赴英國倫敦Soho區，探 …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV節目《港出好味道》第3集由COLLAR成員Gao夥拍廚藝專家Kit Mak遠赴英國倫敦Soho區，探訪前5星級酒店港人總廚Michael自立門戶創辦的人氣麵包店ONSU。這間日產12款港式麵包的餅店門外經常大排長龍，甚至成功打破當地食客偏愛傳統西式糕點的習慣。一眾主持親自品嚐熱賣麻辣雞包後，意外揭開這款日賣數百個名物背後與別不同的高效率研發秘密。</p>\n<h2>COLLAR殺入倫敦餅店見證火爆人潮</h2>\n<p>節目主持Gao及Kit Mak親身來到這間位於英國倫敦Soho區唐人街附近的人氣餅店，直擊店員由清晨6時開始籌備發酵麵糰至早上11時開門營業前爭分奪秒的實況。店舖每日堅持提供新鮮出爐產品，主力製作12款麵包及約10款蛋糕，當中人氣款式日賣高達300至400個，吸引大批本地及華人食客在門外大排長龍。兩位靚女主持更獲邀親自落場協助將麻辣雞包上架及體驗收銀工作，現場顧客絡繹不絕流轉極快。</p>\n<h2>前酒店總廚Michael英國開店的堅持與執著</h2>\n<p>針對餅店在競爭激烈的英國市場突圍而出，總廚Michael在受訪時明確表達強烈的個人風格。他強調品牌核心理念是必須提供新鮮出爐產品，並主張以個人口味為標準，直言「你就是要食我呢一個麵包」，拒絕盲目迎合大眾而失去特色。談及新派麻辣雞包的誕生過程，他透露現時店內採用極高靈活度的研發流程，將以往在酒店需時4個月的產品推出週期大幅縮短，只需經過初步試驗便能迅速推出市場測試反應。</p>\n<h2>拆解爆紅港式包底蘊 主理人多年歐洲高級食府經驗</h2>\n<p>追溯這間人氣餅店的誕生背景，Michael早於2009年抵達英國發展，多年來曾先後在不同知名米芝蓮餐廳及5星級酒店任職，最終晉升至The Dorchester酒店的行政糕點主廚。他在歐洲生活期間強烈懷念香港那種新鮮出爐麵包的風味，促使他毅然放棄高薪厚職自立門戶。為了在異國重現這份地道滋味，他特別招攬來自香港、台灣、日本及韓國等亞洲多地的員工組成混合國籍團隊，將傳統港式烘焙技術與西方高端餐飲管理經驗互相結合。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚創新麻辣包 揚威海外夠貼地</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，大批網民對這間遠在倫敦的港式餅店深感興趣，紛紛在社交平台留言讚賞Michael的職人精神。不少觀眾對麻辣雞包及和牛咖喱包的破格配搭感到驚喜，有網民表示「估唔到英國都有咁高質嘅港式包」，認為店主成功將香港美食文化揚威海外。同時亦有曾經光顧的食客在網上分享真實食評，形容味道「真係香港人啱自己香港嘅味道」，並指鹹蛋黃千層酥的層次感極為豐富，直指即使需要長時間排隊等候依然物超所值。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17938118422051802_20108398996aeb65835b024.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar COLLAR成員Gao夥拍廚藝專家Kit Mak遠赴英國倫敦Soho區，探訪人氣港式麵包店ONSU。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17938118422051802_20108398996aeb65835b024.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>COLLAR成員Gao夥拍廚藝專家Kit Mak遠赴英國倫敦Soho區，探訪人氣港式麵包店ONSU。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381184934910588_8835742526aeb658a08c6a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Gao和Kit親自落場學整麻辣雞包。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381184934910588_8835742526aeb658a08c6a.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Gao和Kit親自落場學整麻辣雞包。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381185794418315_13157173156aeb65923ce3e.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Gao和Kit幫手招呼客人，老問的秘訣是：唔好太慢得啦！（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381185794418315_13157173156aeb65923ce3e.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Gao和Kit幫手招呼客人，老問的秘訣是：唔好太慢得啦！（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381186468895619_17245859746aeb6599742e9.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Gao和Kit與港人顧客傾偈，聽聽她們的評價。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381186468895619_17245859746aeb6599742e9.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Gao和Kit與港人顧客傾偈，聽聽她們的評價。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381187314792781_472114556aeb65a19c0c5.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Gao獲男Fans捧場，當然順勢sell多幾個包。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381187314792781_472114556aeb65a19c0c5.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Gao獲男Fans捧場，當然順勢sell多幾個包。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17938118822818513_13335097786aeb65aaeee1b.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Gao他鄉遇Fans，順便埋枱傾偈，了解他們在倫敦的生活。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17938118822818513_13335097786aeb65aaeee1b.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Gao他鄉遇Fans，順便埋枱傾偈，了解他們在倫敦的生活。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381188859046444_1702697886aeb65b119297.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Michael曾任The Dorchester酒店行政糕點主廚，因強烈懷念香港新鮮出爐麵包的風味而毅然自立門戶。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381188859046444_1702697886aeb65b119297.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Michael曾任The Dorchester酒店行政糕點主廚，因強烈懷念香港新鮮出爐麵包的風味而毅然自立門戶。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381189506175402_19669400956aeb65b784e2f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Michael帶Gao和Kit逛唐人街。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381189506175402_19669400956aeb65b784e2f.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Michael帶Gao和Kit逛唐人街。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381190231752166_19710854476aeb65beac971.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar 餅店日產12款港式麵包，門外經常大排長龍，成功打破當地食客偏愛傳統西式糕點的習慣。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179381190231752166_19710854476aeb65beac971.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>餅店日產12款港式麵包，門外經常大排長龍，成功打破當地食客偏愛傳統西式糕點的習慣。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/collar/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">COLLAR</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b8%af%e5%87%ba%e5%a5%bd%e5%91%b3%e9%81%93/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">港出好味道</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%8b%b1%e5%9c%8b%e7%be%8e%e9%a3%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">英國美食</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：ViuTV資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3536160\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 5 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T18:21:34.430666+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1834,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T17:05:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:14:41.690676+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T18:14:41.690676+00:00","content_hash":"59d53b4dad3909e5105f8b8a32089103c423318e3707e7f86897a22567352667","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}